<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19808" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βένθος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, poet., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάθος</span>
			, <i>depth</i> of the sea, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ βένθος ἁλός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.38
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				49
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλὸς βένθοσδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.780
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				8.51
			</span></i>: in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅστε θαλάσσης πάσης βένθεα οἶδεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.53
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν βένθεσσιν ἁλός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.358
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βένθεσι λίμνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.21
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				32
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαθείης βένθεσιν ὕλης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.316
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βένθεϊ σῆς κραδίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.273
				</span></i>
			 (Paul. Sil.).—Used also by <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				35.3
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				7.57
			</span></i>, and in lyr., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				304
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				666
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαθύς</span>.)</div>
